<title>GERMANY: Bright Air launches Rotterdam-Munich service.</title>
<headline>Bright Air launches Rotterdam-Munich service.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Start-up Dutch carrier Bright Air said it has launched scheduled services between Rotterdam and Munich.</p>
<p>The airline flies twice-daily in each direction using a Metroliner II commuter aircraft, a company statement said. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
